flowchart TD
    A["Shell tool request"] --> B["Resolve cwd, command, permissions"]
    B --> C{"Approval required?"}
    C -->|yes| D["Ask human / policy reviewer"]
    D --> E{"Decision"}
    E -->|deny / timeout| F["Do not execute; return denial"]
    E -->|approve| G["Select sandbox attempt"]
    C -->|no| G
    G --> H{"Network managed?"}
    H -->|yes| I["Network policy / approval observer"]
    H -->|no| J["Run command in sandbox"]
    I --> J
    J --> K["Capture exit code and output"]
    K --> L["Tool result to loop and events"]
    J -->|sandbox failure needing escalation| C
